msgstr ""
"Tega nabavnega naloga ni mogoče spremeniti, ker je ustrezna prodaja v stanju "
"%(state)s"

#. module: purchase_sale_inter_company
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_sale_inter_company/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
msgid "You cannot create SO from PO because product '%s' is not intercompany"
msgstr ""
"Prodajnega naloga ni mogoče ustvariti na osnovi nabavnega, ker proizvoda "
"'%s' ni v sklopu strukturiranih družb"

#. module: purchase_sale_inter_company
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_sale_inter_company/models/purchase_order.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot create SO from PO because sale price list currency is different "
"than purchase price list currency."
msgstr ""
"Prodajnega naloga ni mogoče ustvariti iz nabavnega, ker je valuta prodajnega "
"cenika drugačna od valute nabavnega cenika."

